      "question_links_html": "<li><p>At what stages does a request wait after submission returns 0, and who signals completion?</p><p><a href=\"#제출에서-완료까지\">From submission to completion</a></p><p>Separate run verification items</p></li><li><p>Who keeps requests, buffers, and fences valid, until when, and who reuses them?</p><p><a href=\"#요청버퍼fence의-수명\">Lifetime of requests, buffers, and fences</a></p><p>Separate run verification items</p></li><li><p>What is the order of waiting queue separation, device cancellation, and return during stop?</p><p><a href=\"#정지와-연결-해제를-구분하기\">Distinguishing stop and disconnect</a></p><p>Separate run verification items</p></li><li><p>Which invariants and failure branches must be revalidated after the change?</p><p><a href=\"#변경-검토와-실행-확인\">Change review and execution check</a></p></li><li><p>What are the observations from the preserved virtual probe, and what remains unverified?</p><p><a href=\"#공개-가상-카메라의-콜백-관찰\">Callback observations for the public virtual camera</a></p></li><li><p>In what order do we narrow down submission messages, preparation waits, device limits, and intersections with stop?</p><p><a href=\"#준비-대기와-재진입을-좁히기\">Narrowing down preparation waits and reentrancy</a></p></li><li><p>Where do UVC submission and DQBUF errors lead to cancellation or frame status?</p><p><a href=\"#uvc의-장치-제출과-완료를-추적하기\">Tracing UVC device submission and completion</a></p></li><li><p>What state remains after STREAMOFF fails, and how are subsequent notifications investigated?</p><p><a href=\"#uvc-정지의-정상-경로와-실패-경계\">The normal path and failure boundary of a UVC stop</a></p></li><li><p>How are the execution thread for each connection type and the last use of the deferred pointer checked?</p><p><a href=\"#콜백의-스레드와-재진입을-구분하기\">Distinguishing callback threads from reentrancy</a></p></li><li><p>When can the buffer be reused between the buffer signal and internal cleanup and request return?</p><p><a href=\"#버퍼-알림과-요청-반환의-내부-경계\">Internal boundaries